          <li><svg><use href="#i-alert"/></svg> In the Var, these rules can change from one commune to another without notice (a neighbouring commune banned dogs from its markets in 2026) — go by the signage posted on site on the day.</li>
          <li><svg><use href="#i-check"/></svg> Market gets crowded at peak times: a short lead is best.</li>
